            <div xml:id="d64-a3">

                <pb facs="0148" n="78" sameAs="frus:frus1867p2/pg78"/>

                <head>[Translation.]</head>
                <p>Important matters and foreign questions should be discussed in council. In
                    addition to this, the questions referred to the daimios for their opinion, will
                    be attended to by the two officers of the imperial court. Other affairs will be
                    settled when the daimios shall be called together at Kioto. Until that time,
                    however, the government of the territories and towns will be carried on as up to
                    the present. Further orders will be issued afterwards.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
